id: genetic-focus-neko-majins-fifth-effect
name: 5th effect of Genetic Focus: Neko Majins
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: genetic-focus-neko-majins
fromEffect: 5
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Genetic Focus: Neko Majins' fifth effect, as a Maneuver: an Instant, 1 Action - an Integrated Majin-Dama expelled, dropped or Equipped.
text: >
  (5)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you can spend 1 Action to expel an Integrated Majin-Dama from your body. When you do, it stops being Integrated and is dropped or Equipped (your choice).

---

# Owned by every character, listed while Genetic Focus: Neko Majins is had (`fromTrait`). An Instant costs no Action of its own: its
# 1 Action paid as it is expelled - a Standard one on your turn, a Counter one off it. Refused with none Integrated or no
# Action left (majin-dama.mjs whyNotMajinDama); which, and dropped or Equipped, asked (majin-dama.mjs expelMajinDama).
[on used]
expelMajinDama();
